      "text": [
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "Commercial Property",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Building Confidence with Comprehensive Coverage for Property and Engineering Ventures",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "Our Group",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "ION Insurance Company stands at the forefront of the global insurance industry, specializing in reinsurance, insurance, and various insurance-based risk mitigation strategies, working to make the world more resilient. The aim of the ION is to enable society to thrive and progress, creating new opportunities and solutions for its clients.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "The sea carries both opportunities and risks. Ion’s Marine Insurance provides the assurance you need, covering physical loss or damage to ships, cargo, and marine transport means. Whether battling the stormy seas or docked at a bustling port, our coverage is your steadfast ally.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "Our Partners",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "text": "Inver Re",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Founded in 2021, Inver Re is an independent specialist risk strategy and reinsurance broker based in London, Bermuda, and the US. Inver Re brings a..",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "text": "Tysers Insurance Broker",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Insurance for over 200 years. Founded in 1820, Tysers is a leading independent international Lloyd's broker. Based at the heart of the world's premier insurance...",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "text": "CBC Insurance",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "At CBC, we offer our clients independent advice and insurance solutions, whether they are private individuals, intermediaries or international...",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "text": "Miller Insurance",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Miller is one of the leading specialist insurance and reinsurance brokers operating through Lloyd's, the London market and internationally...",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "text": "Amwins",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Amwins understands your clients' businesses aren't static — they're complex and evolutionary in nature, and require future-focused insurance solutions that keep...",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "text": "Ensurance",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Since 1998 ensurance.com has been the internet's number one place to find the best deal on car insurance and homeowners insurance while preparing you for...",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "Frequently Asked Questions",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Ion Insurance offers a diverse range of insurance coverages including Commercial Property, Marine, Aviation, Corporate, Liability, Surety, and Specialty insurance. These coverages cater to a wide array of business needs, ensuring comprehensive protection for various commercial ventures. Our extensive portfolio allows businesses to secure tailor-made insurance solutions under one roof.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "Connect With Us",
          "where": "main"
